{
  "_readme": [
    "Curated Shopify storefronts for ingest-shopify.mjs. Every Shopify store",
    "exposes a public, unauthenticated product feed at /products.json — title,",
    "price, availability, and the FULL image gallery. No API key, no approval.",
    "",
    "IMPORTANT — some headless storefronts (Gymshark, Fashion Nova) block or drop",
    "/products.json on their custom domain but serve it from the INTERNAL",
    "*.myshopify.com host. Find it with:  node ingest-shopify.mjs --discover",
    "https://brand.com  (greps the homepage source for myshopify.com). MOST",
    "brands, though, serve /products.json straight from their custom domain — for",
    "those, feed == store.",
    "",
    "  feed  = origin for /products.json (data)",
    "  store = the public storefront origin (outbound product links users see)",
    "",
    "Coverage spans women's + men's apparel, makeup/beauty, shoes/footwear,",
    "tech/gadgets, and giftable food so the recommendation feed has real,",
    "gallery-rich products for every recipient + vibe. All feeds below were",
    "probed live (Jul 2026): 200 with multi-image galleries. Re-verify a host",
    "with:  node ingest-shopify.mjs --dry-run --store <brand> --limit 5",
    "Politeness: 250 products/request, throttled, 429-aware."
  ],
